# armour/shared/pauldron_fur5_l: the great FUR pauldron on the left shoulder (fur.5; FORGE-MANTLE, the envelope: PLAN "The envelope", STYLE_P2 29).
# a fur mantle over the shoulder and the collar: 2-4 px tufts with lit tips, a soft ragged foot (MANTLE; the
# envelope's great size).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair); the side views the large
